version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-10
repository-code: "https://github.com/zouzh14/erdos-993-eventual"
url: "https://github.com/zouzh14/erdos-993-eventual"
abstract: >-
  Preprint and Lean 4 formalization proving that the independence-polynomial
  coefficient sequence of every sufficiently large finite forest is unimodal.
  The threshold is existential, and the all-orders Erdos Problem 993 remains
  unresolved.
keywords:
  - "independence polynomial"
  - "unimodality"
  - "finite forest"
  - "hard-core model"
  - "Lean 4"
